00:21:40,240 --> 00:21:45,540
And, um, it would get kind of...
然後就會開始…

384
00:21:46,260 --> 00:21:46,940
sweaty.
流汗…

385
00:21:48,780 --> 00:21:51,000
And, uh, and blurry.
目眩神迷…

386
00:21:53,800 --> 00:21:56,140
And then it's just happening.
一切就自然發生…

387
00:21:57,960 --> 00:21:58,520
Oh.

388
00:22:03,280 --> 00:22:05,220
Thanks, man. Good night.
謝謝，瑞秋，晚安！

389
00:22:07,860 --> 00:22:07,940
Oh!
天啊！

390
00:22:09,700 --> 00:22:11,220
Oh, God.
天啊！

391
00:22:15,660 --> 00:22:19,320
I'm singing in the rain

392
00:22:19,320 --> 00:22:22,180
Yes, singing in the rain

393
00:22:22,180 --> 00:22:27,200
What a glorious feeling I'm having

394
00:22:27,200 --> 00:22:28,120
Good morning.
早安！

395
00:22:30,060 --> 00:22:32,360
Well, somebody got some last night.
昨晚有人爽到了！

396
00:22:37,460 --> 00:22:38,480
Twice.
兩次！

397
00:22:42,220 --> 00:22:43,260
Yes.

398
00:22:44,000 --> 00:22:46,560
Singing in the rain